OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightess at first in the
OL,6,Feast. Otherwise cloudy with further
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain,
OL,8,Foften heavy. Strong north to
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly winds across the
OL,10,FHebrides.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with further outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, heavy at first, then becoming
OL,14,Fmainly dry later in the night. Breezy
OL,15,Ffor a time then winds easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FThere will be variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud with bright spells
OL,19,Fand scattered showers. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
